obsidian-ui4a-renderer
======================

An Obsidian plugin that renders UI4A-protocol TSX widgets as interactive
React components inside notes.

Vendored component library
--------------------------
The component library under `src/vendor/` is vendored from the Macaron
project (MindLab Research):

  Source:    https://github.com/MindLab-Research/macaron-artifacts
  Vendored at commit: e9dbee4a9f106951569a69730a9d72be22d2483e (2026-07-22)

These files are:
  - src/vendor/macaron/source.tsx          (the 118-export component registry)
  - src/vendor/components/ui/*.tsx         (shadcn/Radix primitives)
  - src/vendor/genui/charts.tsx            (Recharts-backed chart primitives)
  - src/vendor/genui/lucide-react.tsx
  - src/vendor/hooks/use-file-upload.ts
  - src/vendor/lib/{progressiveBlur,standalone-uno,style}.ts

All other code (src/runtime/, src/codeblock-processor.ts, src/main.ts,
src/styling.ts, esbuild.config.mjs) is the Obsidian adaptation layer
written for this plugin.

